# Standalone program; EYE answer directives use log:query.

# Source file: issue141/test2.n3
@base <https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/issue141/test2.n3>.
@prefix : <http://www.example.com/ns/ex#> .

{?p a :Reflexive. ?p :range-include ?C} => {
  {?x ?p ?x} <= {?x a ?C}.
}.

:like a :Reflexive; :range-include :Human.
:Socrates a :Human.

